      "content": "Lightweight server-side detection API. The customer relays the inbound client HTTP request (method, url, headers, body) to Arkose Edge, which returns a risk assessment and allow/deny recommendation from consortium intelligence — for surfaces where client-side JavaScript/SDK cannot run (mobile backends, IoT, programmatic APIs). Generated by API Evangelist from the published Arkose Labs Edge API documentation.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Arkose Labs Support",
